{%- comment -%}
One number of the summary of CI test results.

Parameters:
- label: What the number is.
- value: The number, or text.
- kind: Suffix of the CSS class coloring the value; "zero" for a 0 value.
{%- endcomment %}
<div class="test-results-tile"><span class="test-results-tile-value test-results-tile-{{ kind | escape }}">{{ value | thousands | escape }}</span><span class="test-results-tile-label">{{ label | escape }}</span></div>
